  {
   "id": "chip-n-clawz-vs-the-brainioids-333089@major-2025-11-05",
   "gameId": "chip-n-clawz-vs-the-brainioids-333089",
   "displayName": "The Area Control update is almost here!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-11-05T19:33:10.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hello brain-squishers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We know it’s been a while, but the next update is around the corner! It will bring some bug fixes, Skirmish Pack 2 with a difficulty rebalance, and a brand-new Area Control multiplayer map. We just need a few more days to resolve all technical issues on our side, since this is a simultaneous cross-platform update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The new Area Control map is out of control! It’s very cool, we are playing it every day and are having a blast. Skirmish on the hardest difficulties here is a real brain-melter, and we can’t wait to do the update for you to try it. For those of you who’re not looking for the toughest challenge on the Mothership, Skirmish’s easier difficulties are more relaxed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Thank you for all the feedback in Discord, too! If you haven’t already, consider joining there and don’t hesitate to send an invite for a game or two! Here’s a small sneak peek at Minda’s Retreat:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45434129/eb3ae3125b96e91666c4e68a8ed85016e79d1d6b.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The HQ is landing very soon! Stay tuned!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-The Snapshot Games team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
